  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emission, Impact and Control Policy of Black Carbon in Northern China</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to identify ways to improve air quality and reduce negative impacts of black carbon/organic carbon (BC/OC) on air quality, health and climate in Northern China. It is jointly implemented by Chinese Research Academy of Environmental Sciences and Norwegian Environment Agency.</narrative>
  </description>
